    {
      "id": "268E47Z85PePBTYCiULde",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 270.734375,
      "y": -42.37109375,
      "width": 583.1395874023438,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1361967564,
      "version": 761,
      "versionNonce": 1607669620,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781817125186,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* Able to submit long URL and receive shortened url version\n* Able to specify expiration date for shortened URL??\n* Able to access through shorten URL\n---\n* authentication and account management??\n* analytics on links (click/geographic data)\n\nNon-functional requirement\n1. uniqeness in short code mapped to long URL\n2. Redirection should occur with minimal delay\n3. Reliability & availability 99.99%\n4. Scale to support 1B shorten URLs, 100M DAU\n----\n* data consistency in real-time analytics\n* spam detection, malicious URL filtering",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Able to submit long URL and receive shortened url version\n* Able to specify expiration date for shortened URL??\n* Able to access through shorten URL\n---\n* authentication and account management??\n* analytics on links (click/geographic data)\n\nNon-functional requirement\n1. uniqeness in short code mapped to long URL\n2. Redirection should occur with minimal delay\n3. Reliability & availability 99.99%\n4. Scale to support 1B shorten URLs, 100M DAU\n----\n* data consistency in real-time analytics\n* spam detection, malicious URL filtering",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
